    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Skookum Educational Programs?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense, Department of Homeland Security, and Department of Energy are Skookum Educational Programs' top buyers in FY2026 to date. The Department of Defense obligated $219M, the Department of Homeland Security obligated $20.8M, the Department of Energy obligated $10.6M, the Department of Health and Human Services obligated $6.2M, and the Department of State obligated $4.9M."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Skookum Educational Programs sell to the government?",
      "a": "Skookum Educational Programs primarily sells facilities and facility-related services to the government. Facilities Support Services account for $231M, Janitorial Services account for $15.2M, Administrative Management and General Management Consulting Services account for $3.2M, and Landscaping Services account for $3.2M, with additional work in Food Service Contractors $2.9M and maintenance and storage markets."
